  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of Protection Services and Site Management Support to Forcibly Displaced People</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project addresses the critical needs of conflict-affected people in the Darfur and Kordofan regions of Sudan by strengthening protection and site management activities, particularly in hard-to-reach areas. The project targets a combined total of 11,975 affected people with Protection and CCCM activities.</narrative>
  </description>
